WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.560
What happens when a Michael&nbsp;
Jackson album is placed in SCP-914?&nbsp;

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:10.080
Dr. Richard and Dr. Christopher placed a disc&nbsp;
copy of the Michael Jackson 2001 studio album&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:14.160
Invincible into SCP-914 on the setting "Fine."

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:17.520
Dr. Richard noted, “I'm expecting&nbsp;
a cheap and unfunny joke.”

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:21.600
The output produced was an ICarly&nbsp;
box-set titled "I &lt;3 ICarly!"

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:24.480
Dr. Richard then sighed, and said, “Knew it.”

